{{Term/Store|Butterfly|Butterflies|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC, AoI|plural}} are recurring [[Animal]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref>{{Cite Book|quote= |book= E |publisher= |page= 66}}</ref><ref name="BotW Hyrule Compendium"/><ref name="TotK Hyrule Compendium"/><ref name="AoC Material"/><ref name="AoI Materials"/>

==Characteristics==
==={{LA|-}}===
{{Stub|LA}}
In {{LA|-}}, Butterflies follow [[Link]].

==={{OoT|-}}===
{{Stub|OoT}}
If Link holds a [[Deku Stick]] and walks slowly near a Butterfly, it may land on the tip of the Stick. In doing so, it will transform into a [[Fairy]].

==={{MM|-}}===
{{Stub|MM}}

==={{TMC|-}}===
{{Main|Joy Butterfly}}
Joy Butterflies appear in {{TMC}} after [[Kinstone Fusion|Fusing]] [[Kinstone Piece]]s with [[Farore (Oracle)|Farore]], [[Nayru (Oracle)|Nayru]], or [[Din (Oracle)|Din]]. They can be found in [[Castor Wilds]], the [[Royal Valley]], and the [[Wind Ruins]]. Catching a Joy Butterfly will increase [[Link]]'s speed while digging,<ref>{{Cite|You caught a Joy Butterfly! You can now dig faster than before.|N/A|TMC}}</ref> [[Swimming]],<ref>{{Cite|You caught a Joy Butterfly! You can now swim faster than before.|N/A|TMC}}</ref> or shooting [[Arrow]]s,<ref>{{Cite|You caught a Joy Butterfly! You can now shoot arrows faster than before.|N/A|TMC}}</ref>

==={{TP|-}}===
{{Main|Golden Butterfly}}
{{Stub|TPHD}}

==={{SS|-}}===
{{Main|Blessed Butterfly}}
{{Stub|SS}}

==={{TFH|-}}===
In {{TFH}}, the [[Fabled Butterfly]] is a [[Material]] used for crafting the [[Sword Master Suit]]. It is the rarest Material from the [[Sky Realm]], and can only be collected by completing all of the realm's [[Drablands Challenge]]s, or won at random in the [[Coliseum]].

The first volume of the [[Drablands Diary]] describes the author's hardships from adventuring into the [[Woodlands]], mentioning that the sight of a delicate Butterfly gave him the determination to survive. This text alludes to the single, bright green Butterfly that is hidden in each [[Level]] of the Woodlands. However, there is no significance to finding this Butterfly.

